 veil</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit crew from around the world. Solve their problems, and they will join you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deep into a rich fantasy story where your high-tech adventures clash with a magical industry setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the mystery of the Veil, a magical dome separating the kingdom of Raesenia from the outside world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677720/extras/762a82f463be0d5189e23724affad61c.poster.avif?t=1768435784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677720/extras/762a82f463be0d5189e23724affad61c.webm?t=1768435784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677720/extras/762a82f463be0d5189e23724affad61c.mp4?t=1768435784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the Discord for updates and access to playtests! Link is on the right!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Holofox Software LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677720/e5dfff27d4d2910da95666ee122f221d19a6927b/header.jpg?t=1768435784","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2025 Holofox Software LLC","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mint/ubuntu/Arch<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 8th generation Intel or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4098 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated GPU with at least 6GB of VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB availab